WEBVTT

00:13:26.711 --> 00:13:30.331
That may not always be the case.

00:13:30.331 --> 00:13:32.969
Today might be the only time

00:13:32.969 --> 00:13:35.852
that these two things coincide,

00:13:35.852 --> 00:13:39.827
such that we can afford the aid

00:13:39.827 --> 00:13:43.470
that we've always aspired to give.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:51.900
So, can we print money for international aid?

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:55.638
I seriously believe the question should be,

00:13:55.638 --> 00:13:57.701
why not?

00:13:57.701 --> 00:14:00.514
Thank you very much.